    [Refactor][MRV2][PCP] Reuse upstream capture staging and manager helpers (#19350)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Remove duplicate PCP capture staging and manager helpers in MRV2. Pass
    `pcp_manager` through the upstream capture interface and reuse upstream
    global-batch, block-table, and speculator setup. Keep the non-last PP
    global-batch handling required by vLLM v0.31.0.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    Affected unit tests showed no additional failures versus base. Five NPU
    comparisons (GQA DCP1/2, MLA+MTP, MLA+PP, and SFA) matched output tokens
    and logprobs.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
